<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκή</span> A)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pointed object</i>; hence,
				<i>needle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; <i>splinter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετροτόμος ἀ.</span>, of a
			chisel, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.221
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theaet.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>barb</i> of an arrow or hook, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκίστρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>arrow, dart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				443
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.151
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρως . . ἡ φρενῶν ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Tim.Com.
				2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθων ἀκίδες</span>
			<i>stings</i> of desire, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.76
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>): in pl., <i>sharp, acute pains</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> surgical
				<i>bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).823
			</span></i>.</div>
